MEMORY.md there indexes your notes from earlier conversations. When an index line is relevant to the task, read that note with read_file at its full path there. Save a note only when the user asks you to remember something or states a lasting preference: write a new .md file in English there, starting with
---
description: run the tests with pnpm test
---
then add its line to MEMORY.md: "- [Tests](tests.md) - run the tests with pnpm test".

